16 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-10T12:30:24Z", "repo": "dotemacs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fdcfca07a396591874d13817c7e61d588b252878", "message": "Update pi-coding-agent", "created_at": "2026-02-08T02:16:40Z", "repo": "dotemacs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b81e430e908b83822b9d63a614706baa052f425f", "message": "Update deps", "created_at": "2026-02-08T02:16:11Z", "repo": "dotemacs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9cdc623f1efb7f6553e60b4a37f9a1deabbc1378", "message": "Get rid of lsp-ltex", "created_at": "2026-02-04T08:08:35Z", "repo": "dotemacs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "25a0baa89c2194ac7dfbacfe555e338db1e20c62", "message": "Add pi-coding-agent session switcher on C-c C\n\nAdd my/pi-switch-session command that lists all active pi sessions\nand displays the selected one with its chat + input buffer pair.\nShows project directory, session name, and streaming status in the\npicker.\n\nRemove claude-code C-c C binding to free the key.", "created_at": "2026-02-03T05:02:43Z", "repo": "dotemacs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "41e3ac54965160e86411732a8ea3c964c645bb64", "message": "Remove profile system (straight-register-package/when guards)\n\nStrip all straight-register-package calls, when my/enable-* wrappers,\nand delete emacs-profiles.el. All packages are now loaded directly\nvia plain use-package calls.\n\nReverts the pattern introduced in ebbe5db92d9.", "created_at": "2026-02-03T00:48:51Z", "repo": "dotemacs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "71facba540834c12fc3a09a5797ed9e63d2e2236", "message": "Stop tracking .claude/settings.local.json\n\nRemove from git index and add to .gitignore. The file remains